Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Created: 01 FEB 2023

About:

This directory contains a number of source files modified to duplicate Oscar Agertz's Ramses patch shared by him with me and fully self-contained in:

/Users/tepper/codes/ramses_agertz/ramses

The idea is to merge his changes with the most updated Ramses version and keep it that way as Ramses evolves.

Note that the sub-folder 'dice' contains its own README and is thus omitted here.

The file filesf90_list.txt contains a list of the files in here, e.g. for convenience in case they need to be recopied from the main branch or O.Agertz's patch. -> filesf90_list.txt does not exist anymore but can be easily generated!

IMPORTANT:

	- units.f90 has been renamed so that it is not longer compiled and overriden by tepper/amr/units.f90. Note that this change MUST be accompanied by including the following block in the NML file (also when running Oscar's original setup!)

	&UNITS_PARAMS
	units_density = 1.573391528d-26			! g/cm^3 = 1 H / cm^3
	units_time    = 3.00386047142391D+15 	! s; irrelevant if poisson=.true.
	units_length  = 3.0856776D+21 			! cm = 1 kpc
	/

	- feedback.f90 has been copied directly, as it seemed OK to do so

	- condinit.f90 has been copied direclty

	- metal_yields.f90 does not exist in the current Ramses version and has been copied directly; note that this requires an appropriate Makefile:

	/Users/tepper/codes/ramses_fork/bin/Makefile_3D_GNU_OLDMPI0_OAgertz

	which also contains other modifications wrt my standar Makefiles, e.g. NMETALS = 2, etc.

	Note that metal_yields.f90 may in fact not be needed (ask Oscar)
